---
args: {"schedule": "EvidencePage", "projects": "BillingCase[]"}
returns: "ObligationClock[]"
---
Extract the contractual event that authorizes billing for each identified deliverable. Distinguish effort, completion, delivery, acknowledgment and acceptance. Attach signatory or deemed-acceptance prerequisites, phase boundaries and exact rate schedule references. Retain conditions applying only to a named portion. Do not infer billing rights from ordinary commercial practice when the supplied agreement is silent.
